Package: python3-kaggle-tunnel
Version: 0.2.0
Section: python
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-aiohttp
Maintainer: Hamim Mahmud <hamimmahmud0@gmail.com>
Description: Kaggle Tunnel Python module
 SSH proxy, tunnelbroker client, and notebook cell generator
 for connecting Kaggle notebooks back to a local machine.
 .
 This package provides the kaggle_tunnel Python module with CLI
 commands: kaggle-tunnel, kaggle-tunnel-run, and kmux.
